{"seq":3,"slug":"hitstop-feedback","title":"硬直与打击感：把每一下砸实","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-melee-combat-systems/flow/hitstop-feedback","wordCount":1645,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"硬直与打击感-把每一下砸实\">硬直与打击感：把每一下砸实</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>打击感（impact / juice）指命中瞬间那零点几秒里，视觉、听觉、触觉与时间本身协同欺骗感官，让纯数字的扣血变成有物理重量的冲击。其核心手段是<strong>硬直</strong>（hitstop，命中瞬间双方冻结数帧，把注意力钉在接触点上），配合双方非对称冻结与多通道反馈同步。硬直既是手感支柱的顶梁柱，又反过来是 <a href=\"cancels-buffering\">取消与输入缓冲</a> 里连招衔接的时序基础。</p>\n<p>同一套判定、同样的伤害数字，一个游戏的挥砍&quot;砸得人肉一颤&quot;，另一个&quot;像挥空气&quot;。差别在打击感（impact / juice）——命中瞬间那零点几秒里，视觉、听觉、触觉与时间本身如何协同欺骗玩家的感官，让一次纯数字的扣血变成有物理重量的冲击。本篇是打击感的主讲篇，其中最核心的手段是硬直（hitstop），它既是手感支柱的顶梁柱，又反过来是 <a href=\"cancels-buffering\">取消与输入缓冲</a> 里连招衔接的时序基础。</p>\n<h2 id=\"硬直-命中瞬间的时间停顿\">硬直：命中瞬间的时间停顿</h2><p>硬直（hitstop，又称命中冻结、impact freeze）指命中的那一帧，攻防双方的动画与逻辑推进都暂停几帧，仿佛时间被砸出一个凹坑。它是打击感最有效的单一手段——不改任何数值，只在命中瞬间冻结 3 到 10 帧，就能让攻击&quot;有了重量&quot;。冻结时长通常与攻击强度挂钩：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mtext>stop</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mtext>base</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌊</mo><msub><mi>k</mi><mtext>dmg</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌋</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_{\\text{stop}} = f_{\\text{base}} + \\lfloor k_{\\text{dmg}} \\cdot D \\rfloor</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">stop</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">base</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌊</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">dmg</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mclose\">⌋</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 是伤害、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mtext>dmg</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k_{\\text{dmg}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">dmg</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是强度系数、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mtext>base</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_{\\text{base}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">base</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是基础冻结帧。轻击冻结两三帧、重击冻结八九帧，玩家立刻能&quot;感觉到&quot;重攻更沉。</p>\n<p>一个至关重要的实现细节：硬直冻结的是<strong>逻辑帧推进</strong>，而非简单地把画面定住。冻结期间攻击框的激活计数、状态机的帧计数都应暂停，这样硬直既不会改变帧优势（见 <a href=\"../hitreg/active-frames\">起手/判定/收招帧</a> 的帧优势公式，双方同时冻结相互抵消），也不会让判定帧被意外拉长而误判第二次命中。很多&quot;打第一下就无限连&quot;的 bug，根子就在硬直没有正确冻结判定的激活区间。</p>\n<h2 id=\"双方非对称冻结与顿挫\">双方非对称冻结与顿挫</h2><p>进阶做法是<strong>非对称硬直</strong>：攻击方和受击方冻结帧数不同。让受击方多冻结几帧、攻击方少冻结，攻击方就能更早从冻结中恢复继续攻击，制造&quot;我压着你打&quot;的顿挫节奏；反之可做出&quot;被弹开&quot;的手感。格斗游戏还会在特定招（如重拳命中）临时拉长攻击方硬直做&quot;蓄力顿帧&quot;，把最狠的一下的分量再往上抬。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    HIT[命中判定成立] --&gt; FREEZE[进入硬直&lt;br/&gt;冻结逻辑帧]&#10;    FREEZE --&gt; V[视觉:命中特效+震屏]&#10;    FREEZE --&gt; A[听觉:打击音效分层]&#10;    FREEZE --&gt; H[触觉:手柄震动]&#10;    FREEZE --&gt; ASYM{非对称冻结?}&#10;    ASYM --&gt;|攻击方少冻| PRESS[攻击方先恢复&lt;br/&gt;压制节奏]&#10;    ASYM --&gt;|受击方少冻| KB[受击方先恢复&lt;br/&gt;被弹开感]&#10;    FREEZE --&gt; BUF[冻结期=取消输入宽限窗]&#10;    FREEZE --&gt;|计满 f_stop| RESUME[恢复逻辑帧推进]\">graph TD\n    HIT[命中判定成立] --&gt; FREEZE[进入硬直&lt;br/&gt;冻结逻辑帧]\n    FREEZE --&gt; V[视觉:命中特效+震屏]\n    FREEZE --&gt; A[听觉:打击音效分层]\n    FREEZE --&gt; H[触觉:手柄震动]\n    FREEZE --&gt; ASYM{非对称冻结?}\n    ASYM --&gt;|攻击方少冻| PRESS[攻击方先恢复&lt;br/&gt;压制节奏]\n    ASYM --&gt;|受击方少冻| KB[受击方先恢复&lt;br/&gt;被弹开感]\n    FREEZE --&gt; BUF[冻结期=取消输入宽限窗]\n    FREEZE --&gt;|计满 f_stop| RESUME[恢复逻辑帧推进]</pre><h2 id=\"多通道反馈的同步\">多通道反馈的同步</h2><p>硬直把玩家注意力钉在接触点，接下来要在这一瞬间同时递上多路感官信号，且必须<strong>同帧到达</strong>——任何一路延迟几帧都会让打击发虚。四路信号各有讲究：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>通道</th>\n<th>手段</th>\n<th>关键</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>视觉</td>\n<td>命中特效、刀光、白闪、震屏 camera shake</td>\n<td>特效锚在接触点，震屏幅度随强度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>听觉</td>\n<td>分层音效（挥空声/命中肉声/金属声）</td>\n<td>命中声在冻结第一帧触发，不可延迟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>触觉</td>\n<td>手柄震动，强度/时长随攻击</td>\n<td>与视听同帧，短促有力</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时间</td>\n<td>硬直本身</td>\n<td>是其他三路的&quot;舞台&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>震屏（camera shake）是性价比极高的一路：命中时给相机叠加一个快速衰减的小幅位移，强度随攻击强度缩放。但要克制——过度震屏会引起眩晕并淹没画面信息，一般重攻才用明显震屏，且需提供关闭选项（无障碍考量见 <a href=\"../practice/melee-in-practice\">落地与边界</a>）。特效的时序编排（何时白闪、何时喷粒子、层与层如何错开）是一门独立手艺，通用方法见 <a href=\"../../game-vfx-particle-systems/vfx-craft/timing-layering\">VFX 特效 · 时序与分层</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"硬直之外的重量线索\">硬直之外的重量线索</h2><p>打击感不止硬直一招，还有几个廉价而有效的补充。<strong>击退与位移</strong>：命中把受击者向击退向量推开一小段，制造&quot;打飞&quot;的物理感，击退距离随攻击强度变化。<strong>受击闪白</strong>：受击者模型短暂变白或泛红，明确&quot;这一下打中了谁&quot;。<strong>顿挫回弹</strong>：攻击方在命中瞬间动画略微回弹，模拟&quot;打到硬物的反作用力&quot;。<strong>命中停顿后的追帧</strong>：冻结结束时让动画快速追回被冻结的时间，避免看起来慢半拍。这些线索叠加在硬直之上，共同把一次扣血包装成有因果、有重量的冲击。击退如何转化为受击者的具体反应状态，属于 <a href=\"../practice/enemy-reactions\">敌人受击反应</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"手感是被感知的因果链\">手感是被感知的因果链</h2><p>打击感的本质，是让玩家在潜意识里补全一条因果链：我挥刀（预备）→ 砍中（冻结+特效+音效同时炸开）→ 敌人被打退（击退+受击反应）。每个环节都在为&quot;我确实对世界施加了力&quot;提供证据。任何一环缺失或错位——特效晚到、没有击退、冻结不足——都会打断这条链，玩家说不清哪里不对，只会觉得&quot;手感差&quot;。因此调打击感不是加更多特效，而是<strong>对齐时序</strong>：让所有反馈精确落在命中那一帧，再让它们以合理的物理节奏衰减。这也是 <a href=\"../practice/melee-tuning\">手感调校</a> 里投入产出比最高的一类调整。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>硬直是打击感最有效的单一手段，命中瞬间冻结 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mtext>stop</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mtext>base</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌊</mo><msub><mi>k</mi><mtext>dmg</mtext></msub><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌋</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_{\\text{stop}} = f_{\\text{base}} + \\lfloor k_{\\text{dmg}} D \\rfloor</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">stop</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">base</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌊</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">dmg</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mclose\">⌋</span></span></span></span></span> 帧，让攻击有重量。</li>\n<li>硬直必须冻结逻辑帧推进而非仅定住画面，才能既不改帧优势、又不误判第二次命中；非对称冻结可制造压制或弹开节奏。</li>\n<li>打击感靠视觉/听觉/触觉/时间四通道同帧到达，任何一路延迟都会让打击发虚；震屏性价比高但需克制并可关闭。</li>\n<li>击退、受击闪白、顿挫回弹、追帧是硬直之外的重量线索，叠加强化物理感。</li>\n<li>手感本质是玩家潜意识补全的&quot;我施力→命中→敌人退&quot;因果链，调手感=对齐时序，是投入产出比最高的调整。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>硬直充当的取消宽限窗口：<a href=\"cancels-buffering\">取消与输入缓冲</a></li>\n<li>击退落到受击者的反应：<a href=\"../practice/enemy-reactions\">敌人受击反应</a></li>\n<li>跨库：命中特效的时序编排 <a href=\"../../game-vfx-particle-systems/vfx-craft/timing-layering\">VFX 特效 · 时序与分层</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"硬直与打击感：把每一下砸实","id":"硬直与打击感-把每一下砸实"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"硬直：命中瞬间的时间停顿","id":"硬直-命中瞬间的时间停顿"},{"level":2,"text":"双方非对称冻结与顿挫","id":"双方非对称冻结与顿挫"},{"level":2,"text":"多通道反馈的同步","id":"多通道反馈的同步"},{"level":2,"text":"硬直之外的重量线索","id":"硬直之外的重量线索"},{"level":2,"text":"手感是被感知的因果链","id":"手感是被感知的因果链"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"取消与输入缓冲：跟手感从哪里来","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-melee-combat-systems/flow/cancels-buffering"},"next":{"title":"敌人受击反应：打击感的另一半","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-melee-combat-systems/practice/enemy-reactions"}}